Portions derived from Mega-Flink (https://github.com/cb521/Mega-Flink, Apache-2.0).
The CUDA sources in this directory (cuda_device_jni.cu, dense_groupby_jni.cu,
gpu_arch_compat.h, gpu_device_batch.h, gpu_device_batch_jni.cu, lookup_join_jni.cu) and the
structure of build.sh originate there; the JNI symbol prefix was changed to match the Java
package com.nvidia.fep.flink, and gpu_arch_compat.h was generalised (see its header).

Only the CUDA Toolkit headers and the JNI headers of a JDK are needed to build; no third-party
source is bundled.
